👉 Question:
Entire Kubernetes cluster performance degraded.
💡 Debug Steps:
•	Check node usage:
•	kubectl top nodes
•	Check pods consuming resources
•	Check:
o	CPU / Memory pressure
o	Disk I/O
👉 Possible causes:
•	Resource starvation
•	Too many pods on node
•	No resource limits defined
