👉 Question:
How do you securely run multiple teams on same cluster?
💡 Answer:
•	Namespaces per team
•	RBAC (strict access control)
•	Resource quotas
•	Network policies (isolation)
👉 Advanced:
Use separate node pools for critical workloads
